      <description><![CDATA[<h3>0.14.2</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Folders move as one stream</b> when the server has <code>tar</code> —
      10,500 small files to a Raspberry Pi in about 2 seconds, where
      <code>scp -r</code> takes over 20. Nothing appears until the whole folder
      has arrived.</li>
  <li><b>Large files from far-away servers download about 3× faster.</b></li>
</ul>]]></description>
